# Documentation

- Update `PROJECT.md` or `UI_GUIDELINES.md` if an implementation changes the agreed design.
- Do not leave design drift only in code or chat — reflect decisions in the planning docs.
- Keep doc updates scoped to what actually changed; do not rewrite unrelated sections.
- When resolving an open question from those docs, update the doc and remove or mark the question resolved.
